# SPEC-10 — LLM and intelligence

Contract: `docs/spec-references/SPEC-10-llm-intelligence.md`. Inherits SPEC-00. Do not build from it until the user feeds this spec.

Director mode runs intent, affect, ideation, and critique. Auto routing runs only when the shot has no model override. Tiers are `LLM_MECHANICAL`, `LLM_CREATIVE`, and `LLM_HARD` via `llmModelForTier`. All of those calls go through `claudeCall`. There is no Grok stage and no memory toggle. Do not rebuild the director from scratch.
